2026-09-23T02:12:19.6218975Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6219073Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6219151Z     
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6219413Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6219580Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6219653Z     
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6219912Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6220011Z       test suites out of the box
2026-09-23T02:12:19.6220086Z     
